    {
      "QuestionID": 441580,
      "SubjectID": 101,
      "TopicID": 12197,
      "TopicRef": "11",
      "TopicName": "11 THOSE WINTER SUNDAYS (SMART)",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>Sundays too my father got up early</p>\r\n\r\n<p>and put his clothes on in the</p>\r\n\r\n<p>blue cold,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>then with  <strong>cracked</strong>  hands that  <strong>ached</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>from labor in the weekday weather made</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>banked</strong>  fires  <strong>blaze</strong>,  No one ever thanked him.</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 441581,
      "SubjectID": 101,
      "TopicID": 12197,
      "TopicRef": "11",
      "TopicName": "11 THOSE WINTER SUNDAYS (SMART)",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>I'd wake and hear the cold</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>splintering</strong>,  breaking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When the rooms were warm, he'd call,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>and slowly i would rise and dress,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>fearing the  <strong>chronic</strong>  angers of that house,</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 441582,
      "SubjectID": 101,
      "TopicID": 12197,
      "TopicRef": "11",
      "TopicName": "11 THOSE WINTER SUNDAYS (SMART)",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>Speaking  <strong>indifferentl</strong>y  to him,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>who had driven out the cold</p>\r\n\r\n<p>and polished my good shoes as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What did i know, what did i know</p>\r\n\r\n<p>of love's  <strong>austere</strong>  and  <strong>lonely</strong>  <strong>offices</strong>?</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
